      <li>
      Delete the subscription:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc delete subscription <subscription_name> -n <namespace>"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Delete the cluster service version:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc delete csv <csv_name> -n <namespace>"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Get the names of any failing jobs and related config maps in the <code>openshift-marketplace</code> namespace:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc get job,configmap -n openshift-marketplace"} lang="terminal" />
      <CodeBlock code={"NAME                                                                        COMPLETIONS   DURATION   AGE\njob.batch/1de9443b6324e629ddf31fed0a853a121275806170e34c926d69e53a7fcbccb   1/1           26s        9m30s\n\nNAME                                                                        DATA   AGE\nconfigmap/1de9443b6324e629ddf31fed0a853a121275806170e34c926d69e53a7fcbccb   3      9m30s"} lang="terminal" title="Example output" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Delete the job:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc delete job <job_name> -n openshift-marketplace"} lang="terminal" />
      <p>This ensures pods that try to pull the inaccessible image are not recreated.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      Delete the config map:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc delete configmap <configmap_name> -n openshift-marketplace"} lang="terminal" />
